WEBVTT

00:06.006 --> 00:10.010
[theme music]

00:25.316 --> 00:27.736
[paper rustling]

00:28.611 --> 00:29.529
SONG JOONSU

00:30.113 --> 00:31.781
[Cha Giho] Donghoon… No.

00:31.865 --> 00:33.742
Joonsu was undercover.

00:33.825 --> 00:35.618
SONG JOONSU,
INCHANG DRUG INVESTIGATION UNIT

00:35.702 --> 00:37.412
He was our agent…

00:37.495 --> 00:41.624
["My Name" playing]

00:46.880 --> 00:47.714
[Jiwoo] Hey.

00:52.761 --> 00:53.845
How's the Captain?

00:54.512 --> 00:55.930
[Pildo] He's still in surgery.

00:56.556 --> 00:58.058
For four hours now.

01:09.694 --> 01:11.362
I brought him home last night.

01:12.822 --> 01:15.533
He seemed nervous,
so I offered to stay, but he said no.

01:18.411 --> 01:21.998
I'm sure it's Choi Mujin's fault,
but I don't know why.

01:23.708 --> 01:25.210
Why go after the Captain?

01:27.962 --> 01:29.380
We'll catch the guy.

01:29.964 --> 01:31.299
Captain shot him.

01:32.050 --> 01:34.594
We found blood and fingerprints
at the scene.

01:40.350 --> 01:41.601
Why do you look so pale?

01:45.146 --> 01:46.523
I didn't get to sleep much.

01:46.606 --> 01:48.566
[cell phone vibrates]

01:50.401 --> 01:51.402
Hey.

01:52.320 --> 01:53.613
It didn't record?

01:54.781 --> 01:56.950
Get all the surveillance videos
from nearby.

01:57.033 --> 01:58.076
Okay. I'll go too.

02:06.501 --> 02:08.586
[doctor] The surgery went well.

02:08.670 --> 02:11.005
We'll move him to the ICU
and monitor him. Don't worry.

02:11.089 --> 02:13.383
[patient bed rattling]

02:17.220 --> 02:18.888
[Taeju] Cha Giho survived.

02:18.972 --> 02:20.223
I'm sorry.

02:24.727 --> 02:27.313
Jiwoo was there at the scene.

02:28.565 --> 02:30.358
She may have discovered the truth.

02:31.317 --> 02:32.652
We have to kill her.

02:34.988 --> 02:36.281
[Taeju groans]

02:41.995 --> 02:42.829
[clicks tongue]

02:42.912 --> 02:46.833
[breathing heavily]

02:46.916 --> 02:49.294
[monitor beeping]

02:51.546 --> 02:52.881
[breathing heavily]

02:57.051 --> 02:59.304
[liquid trickling]

03:06.644 --> 03:07.687
[groans]

03:07.770 --> 03:09.898
[clicking]

03:09.981 --> 03:11.316
[breathes heavily]

03:15.653 --> 03:16.613
[groans]

03:21.075 --> 03:23.119
[breathes heavily]

03:23.203 --> 03:24.204
[pills rattle]

03:27.123 --> 03:28.249
[deep exhale]

03:29.125 --> 03:31.211
[somber music]

03:50.772 --> 03:51.606
[Pildo] Captain.

04:00.740 --> 04:02.325
[gunshots]

04:05.745 --> 04:06.746
[body thuds]

04:09.707 --> 04:10.917
[sighs]

04:14.921 --> 04:17.674
[Cha Giho] What would you do
if you found your sister's killer?

04:18.925 --> 04:20.510
You find him and there's no…

04:20.593 --> 04:21.594
[inhales sharply]

04:22.929 --> 04:24.222
No evidence?

04:26.266 --> 04:27.892
[Cha Giho] We'll get Choi Mujin.

04:28.726 --> 04:30.603
We'll do it while he's still rattled.

04:39.404 --> 04:41.990
[Ms. Kang] You should stay put
for the time being.

04:42.073 --> 04:45.159
The police are after you
for Gangjae's murder.

04:47.287 --> 04:49.289
[birds chirping]

05:04.470 --> 05:06.097
[Mujin] She wants to get revenge.

05:09.600 --> 05:10.601
Let her.

05:12.687 --> 05:14.981
[dramatic music]

06:24.592 --> 06:25.676
[door lock chimes]

06:27.220 --> 06:29.305
[Jiwoo groaning]

06:29.389 --> 06:30.556
[thwacks]

06:33.267 --> 06:34.185
[Jiwoo gasps]

06:34.268 --> 06:36.854
[burbling]

06:36.938 --> 06:39.565
[tense music]

06:47.907 --> 06:50.952
JEON PILDO

06:51.035 --> 06:53.913
[burbling]

06:55.081 --> 06:56.124
[man 1 groans]

07:00.586 --> 07:01.504
[Jiwoo yelps]

07:01.587 --> 07:02.505
[Jiwoo grunts]

07:02.588 --> 07:03.798
[yells]

07:08.761 --> 07:09.929
[man 1 screams]

07:12.849 --> 07:13.766
[grunts]

07:18.604 --> 07:19.439
[groans]

07:20.565 --> 07:21.566
[grunts]

07:36.080 --> 07:37.582
- [yelps]
- Die, bitch!

07:38.332 --> 07:39.667
[screams in pain]

07:39.750 --> 07:41.169
[both grunting]

07:41.252 --> 07:42.295
[glass shatters]

07:44.297 --> 07:46.299
[panting]

07:50.052 --> 07:50.970
[grunts]

07:51.053 --> 07:52.096
[man 2 yelps]

07:54.098 --> 07:55.892
[panting]

08:16.245 --> 08:17.455
I told you

08:18.789 --> 08:19.916
it was foolish.

08:23.628 --> 08:25.004
You're a traitor's daughter,

08:25.087 --> 08:27.590
but you came to us
and said you'll kill the culprit.

08:28.966 --> 08:30.343
[Taeju] When I served Donghoon,

08:30.426 --> 08:32.220
I got to know him very well.

08:32.803 --> 08:34.472
He didn't belong in this line of work.

08:35.932 --> 08:38.684
[approaching footsteps]

08:39.769 --> 08:42.855
So how does it feel to be a clueless pawn?

08:46.025 --> 08:48.819
[suspenseful music]

08:53.074 --> 08:54.992
It was you who killed my dad, right?

08:56.202 --> 08:58.371
Oh, I wanted to be the one who killed him.

09:01.082 --> 09:03.501
You've never ever seen
the real Choi Mujin.

09:07.046 --> 09:10.675
If you backstabbed him,
he'll make you pay personally.

09:12.843 --> 09:15.763
He enjoys watching them take
their final breath.

09:18.683 --> 09:20.643
I wonder how your father looked.

09:23.437 --> 09:25.106
How will you look when you die?

09:27.316 --> 09:28.651
How about we find out?

09:32.822 --> 09:33.823
[groans]

09:39.245 --> 09:40.246
[grunts]

09:43.207 --> 09:44.125
[glass shatters]

09:44.208 --> 09:46.085
[grunts, pants]

09:47.336 --> 09:49.505
[groaning]

09:55.845 --> 09:56.846
[Jiwoo grunts]

09:57.930 --> 10:00.474
[Taeju groaning]

10:05.646 --> 10:06.480
[moans]

10:09.233 --> 10:10.693
[Taeju screams]

10:12.653 --> 10:13.738
[knife clanks]

10:13.821 --> 10:14.905
[grunts]

10:18.326 --> 10:20.119
[groaning]

10:20.202 --> 10:22.204
[panting]

10:25.499 --> 10:26.500
[yelps]

10:27.251 --> 10:28.836
[groaning]

10:32.131 --> 10:34.550
[both breathing heavily]

10:39.555 --> 10:40.556
[grunts]

10:44.352 --> 10:45.811
[pants]

10:48.022 --> 10:48.856
- [slashes]
- [grunts]

10:49.482 --> 10:50.316
[grunts]

10:51.359 --> 10:52.443
[groans]

10:53.527 --> 10:55.863
[breathing heavily]

10:56.489 --> 10:57.406
[groans]

11:00.534 --> 11:02.495
[thudding]

11:02.578 --> 11:04.205
[panting]

11:04.997 --> 11:06.165
[groans]

11:08.626 --> 11:09.835
[both grunt]

11:10.753 --> 11:13.297
[breathes shakily]

11:13.381 --> 11:15.800
Do you assholes really think
that you're human?

11:16.592 --> 11:17.843
[muttering]
What about…

11:19.261 --> 11:20.221
you?

11:20.971 --> 11:22.515
Are you still human?

11:22.598 --> 11:25.142
[breathes shakily]

11:25.226 --> 11:26.894
- [grunts]
- [Taeju groans]

11:28.270 --> 11:31.899
[squelching]

11:34.110 --> 11:35.569
Did you get the videos?

11:35.653 --> 11:38.030
Yes. Even from the streets nearby.

11:38.114 --> 11:39.865
- Let's see.
- [phone ringing]

11:40.491 --> 11:42.993
Hey, this is Detective Na Daesoo.

11:43.077 --> 11:44.036
Yes.

11:44.870 --> 11:46.205
Yes, what I asked for.

11:48.958 --> 11:49.917
Yes.

11:51.919 --> 11:53.087
Yeah. Where is that?

11:56.298 --> 11:57.299
Okay.

11:59.135 --> 12:00.302
So, 7-35?

12:00.386 --> 12:01.387
Yeah. Thank you.

12:01.470 --> 12:03.639
Uh, can you please head out there first?
We'll meet you.

12:03.723 --> 12:04.890
We'll be right behind you.

12:05.474 --> 12:06.475
Yes. Thank you.

12:07.143 --> 12:08.811
- Let's go.
- Where?

12:09.603 --> 12:12.106
Uh, three days ago, a retired doctor,

12:12.189 --> 12:14.191
treated a man in his 50's
with a stab wound.

12:14.775 --> 12:16.777
- Where did he treat him?
- [Daesoo] Cheonwang Temple.

12:16.861 --> 12:18.863
[tense music]

12:26.704 --> 12:28.831
[suspenseful music]

12:33.502 --> 12:34.837
[Daesoo] Choi Mujin.

12:38.507 --> 12:40.009
Uh… Hey.

12:48.058 --> 12:48.934
[door closes]

12:49.518 --> 12:51.103
- [door lock chimes]
- [groans]

12:55.608 --> 12:58.068
COME IN ASAP
WE GOT CHOI MUJIN

13:24.428 --> 13:25.721
You did this.

13:36.732 --> 13:39.193
[groans]

13:42.029 --> 13:43.781
And Captain Cha Giho.

13:43.864 --> 13:45.866
[Daesoo breathes deeply]

13:47.827 --> 13:48.953
Why did you do it?

13:51.205 --> 13:52.665
Why did you turn yourself in?

13:57.503 --> 13:59.463
Were you scared after stabbing a cop?

14:01.382 --> 14:03.300
Did you feel like it was over?

14:04.426 --> 14:06.595
There are many kinds of people
in this world.

14:10.182 --> 14:12.393
And every person thinks they're special.

14:18.607 --> 14:20.609
But if you take a closer look,

14:22.278 --> 14:24.321
they are only two categories.

14:27.616 --> 14:28.784
The predator…

14:30.995 --> 14:32.121
or the prey.

14:34.915 --> 14:36.709
You eat or get eaten.

14:38.878 --> 14:41.630
[Mujin] Cha Giho was prey
pretending to be a predator.

14:43.507 --> 14:44.967
So he won't live long.

14:48.846 --> 14:49.847
[scoffs]

14:52.808 --> 14:54.143
Which one are you?

14:56.770 --> 14:58.063
You're a murderer

14:58.731 --> 14:59.940
and a drug lord.

15:01.692 --> 15:04.069
You've done the most horrible things.

15:05.195 --> 15:06.405
[scoffs]

15:06.488 --> 15:08.032
And that's your excuse?

15:11.243 --> 15:13.621
You did all this
because you're a predator?

15:16.749 --> 15:18.292
What you've done is wrong.

15:21.128 --> 15:23.797
Think it over in solitary confinement.

15:25.633 --> 15:27.134
You'll have lots of time.

15:31.555 --> 15:32.598
[Mujin] Jeon.

15:33.390 --> 15:34.475
Pil.

15:35.851 --> 15:37.019
Do.

15:38.687 --> 15:40.189
You really think…

15:43.484 --> 15:44.902
I'm going away?

15:55.287 --> 15:56.747
Hey, Pildo.

15:56.830 --> 15:58.666
What is that asshole up to?

15:59.750 --> 16:02.419
We have to wait and see
if he's got something up his sleeve.

16:03.295 --> 16:05.923
That scumbag's done for
once Captain wakes up.

16:08.801 --> 16:09.802
[Daesoo] Huh?

16:09.885 --> 16:11.011
Hold on. Excuse me.

16:11.095 --> 16:12.137
[Daesoo scoffs]

16:12.805 --> 16:14.431
You won't be able to get out of this.

16:17.059 --> 16:20.771
[police siren wailing in distance]

16:21.855 --> 16:22.773
[sighs]

16:24.400 --> 16:25.484
[alarm beeps]

16:32.116 --> 16:33.951
INCHANG METROPOLITAN POLICE AGENCY

16:36.620 --> 16:38.080
- [Daesoo] Hey.
- [door closes]

16:38.163 --> 16:39.289
Where have you been?

16:43.711 --> 16:45.546
How did you end up catching him?

16:46.130 --> 16:47.464
He came in himself.

16:49.591 --> 16:52.344
Pildo is pressuring him
about the Do Gangjae case.

16:53.637 --> 16:55.014
I'll go in there with him.

17:07.568 --> 17:08.819
[door closes]

17:13.741 --> 17:15.242
You turn yourself in?

17:19.204 --> 17:20.205
I…

17:20.956 --> 17:21.999
Please, sir.

17:25.461 --> 17:27.588
I came to prove that I am innocent.

17:44.980 --> 17:47.191
[pensive music]

17:48.817 --> 17:51.070
I never stabbed Do Gangjae.

17:54.865 --> 17:57.159
I never ordered Cha Giho's death either.

18:02.873 --> 18:04.583
Are you relying on him then?

18:06.627 --> 18:08.545
The mole you had among us all.

18:11.048 --> 18:13.383
[Jiwoo] The one who told you
about the cameras at the hotel

18:13.467 --> 18:15.302
and leaked investigation details.

18:15.385 --> 18:16.470
How loyal.

18:19.681 --> 18:22.351
Whoever that is,
it won't be able to get you out.

18:27.272 --> 18:29.608
I witnessed you stabbing Do Gangjae.

18:32.778 --> 18:34.738
We have your knife with your prints.

18:37.866 --> 18:39.201
They're all over it.

18:42.538 --> 18:44.039
There's no need to confess.

18:46.959 --> 18:48.085
HEAD OF LEGAL AFFAIRS
KANG SOOYEON

18:48.168 --> 18:50.003
We'll have the warrant in an hour.

18:57.511 --> 18:59.221
This time you're finished.

19:12.067 --> 19:13.235
[door closes]

19:19.533 --> 19:20.701
[Pildo] Detective Oh.

19:21.869 --> 19:23.036
Leaving?

19:27.708 --> 19:29.334
Just going to my car.

19:29.418 --> 19:30.794
I left something.

19:32.462 --> 19:34.590
The mole? How did you know?

19:37.426 --> 19:38.969
I was giving him a test.

19:40.304 --> 19:41.972
I had to see if he had someone.

19:46.101 --> 19:47.644
So is there a mole?

19:49.021 --> 19:50.063
We're speculating.

19:50.772 --> 19:52.482
I couldn't identify him yet.

19:54.234 --> 19:56.361
Be quick. We got to work.

19:59.907 --> 20:00.908
[Jiwoo] Pildo.

20:07.122 --> 20:08.290
Thank you.

20:10.042 --> 20:11.043
[sighs]

20:11.793 --> 20:13.712
You need to answer my calls.

20:14.296 --> 20:16.882
Whatever the situation is,
you answer my calls.

20:28.852 --> 20:29.853
[door lock beeps]

20:32.814 --> 20:33.774
[door closes]

20:33.857 --> 20:35.025
- [Gunpyeong] Daesoo.
- Hey.

20:35.108 --> 20:36.235
We found him.

20:36.318 --> 20:37.361
What?

20:42.491 --> 20:43.575
[door closes]

20:47.955 --> 20:51.333
[Gunpyeong] That car arrived and left
around the time the Captain was attacked.

20:51.416 --> 20:52.376
[Daesoo] That one?

20:55.796 --> 20:56.797
[keyboard clacks]

20:56.880 --> 20:58.465
- I'll look up the plates.
- Okay.

20:58.548 --> 21:00.425
[Daesoo] Follow him. See where he went.

21:00.968 --> 21:01.969
[door closes]

21:03.428 --> 21:05.931
[tense music]

21:07.349 --> 21:08.850
[door opens, closes]

21:11.311 --> 21:12.604
What is it?

21:12.688 --> 21:14.147
Oh, yes. Hello.

21:15.274 --> 21:16.775
- Captain Cha…
- [Gunpyeong] Yeah?

21:16.858 --> 21:18.527
Requested this be turn over to you.

21:19.861 --> 21:20.946
What is it?

21:21.697 --> 21:24.950
He said to give it to you
if anything were to happen to him.

21:27.077 --> 21:28.870
PHONE CALL RECORDS

21:29.746 --> 21:32.124
CORPORAL OH HYEJIN OF NARCOTICS

21:33.333 --> 21:34.584
Uh… Well, thank you.

21:34.668 --> 21:35.627
[officer] Sure.

21:40.966 --> 21:42.968
[tense music continues]

21:45.762 --> 21:50.976
EVIDENCE STORAGE

21:53.228 --> 21:55.314
[officer] Hi. Can I help you
with something?

21:56.648 --> 21:58.275
I'm here to check some evidence, please.

21:58.859 --> 22:00.068
[officer] Oh. Sure.

22:06.116 --> 22:08.285
[keyboard clacking]

22:18.754 --> 22:21.590
You're looking for evidence
for Do Gangjae's murder case, right?

22:24.051 --> 22:25.260
Yeah, that's right.

22:26.136 --> 22:30.098
Shit. I can't find this car. 60K 8640?

22:30.182 --> 22:31.391
[Gunpyeong] Yes, that's right.

22:33.810 --> 22:35.187
[Daesoo] I think it's a fake plate.

22:35.812 --> 22:36.813
[Gunpyeong] What?

22:43.779 --> 22:46.365
INCHANG METROPOLITAN POLICE AGENCY
EMERGENCY CONTACT LIST

22:46.948 --> 22:48.033
60K 8640

22:48.116 --> 22:49.117
Hang on.

22:50.410 --> 22:53.080
OH HYEJIN, CORPORAL

22:53.163 --> 22:55.624
[tense music]

23:00.045 --> 23:01.797
[officer] Please return it by 6:00 p.m.

23:16.978 --> 23:19.815
7-35, CHEONWANGSAN-RO, BUK-GU, INCHANG

23:22.734 --> 23:24.945
[monk] No one has come here
in a long while.

23:33.829 --> 23:35.789
[Daesoo] Hey, where's Detective Oh?

23:35.872 --> 23:37.457
You really need to come and look at this.

23:50.762 --> 23:52.472
I removed the evidence.

23:56.226 --> 23:57.310
Okay.

24:07.904 --> 24:10.282
[suspenseful music]

24:23.336 --> 24:25.464
Stop Detective Oh Hyejin
from leaving the building.

24:25.547 --> 24:27.132
- [officer on PA] This is the control room.
- [Daesoo] Yes. Okay.

24:27.215 --> 24:28.592
[officer on PA]
Report to the control room immediately

24:28.675 --> 24:30.051
if you spot Corporal Oh Hyejin.

24:30.135 --> 24:33.472
Corporal Oh Hyejin
of the Drug Investigation Unit…

24:33.555 --> 24:35.474
Corporal Oh Hyejin
of the Drug Investigation…

24:36.057 --> 24:37.809
The evidence won't be a problem for us.

24:40.729 --> 24:41.688
Yes.

24:42.898 --> 24:46.318
I'll tell you all the details later
when we meet up in person.

24:48.069 --> 24:50.322
[tense music]

24:58.705 --> 25:00.540
- [radio beeps]
- [Daesoo] She went to the evidence room.

25:00.624 --> 25:02.876
She took evidence
from the Do Gangjae case.

25:07.923 --> 25:10.509
[approaching footsteps]

25:14.763 --> 25:16.348
- [radio beeps]
- [Daesoo] She went by the back door.

25:16.431 --> 25:17.516
The back door!

25:23.939 --> 25:25.941
[motor engine revving]

25:27.609 --> 25:29.819
[thrilling music]

25:33.114 --> 25:34.741
[engine revving]

25:34.824 --> 25:36.409
Unit, close the gate!

25:39.329 --> 25:40.163
[cop] Stop!

25:40.247 --> 25:41.623
[cops yell]

25:41.706 --> 25:43.333
[car horn honks]

25:45.585 --> 25:47.003
[honking continues]

25:48.296 --> 25:50.382
[Daesoo] We're not done questioning you!

25:50.465 --> 25:51.550
Choi Mujin!

25:55.637 --> 25:58.139
There is no reason
for my client to be here any longer.

25:58.932 --> 26:00.767
Call me if you find the evidence.

26:00.850 --> 26:01.935
But I will claim

26:02.686 --> 26:04.604
that the evidence has been tampered with.

26:04.688 --> 26:05.981
[door beeps]

26:11.778 --> 26:14.155
[tense music]

26:17.367 --> 26:18.827
[Daesoo] Did you find Hyejin?

26:18.910 --> 26:21.037
No. I'm sorry, sir.

26:22.581 --> 26:25.166
[tense music continues]

26:30.547 --> 26:33.508
[police siren blaring in distance]

26:35.385 --> 26:36.386
[pants]

26:36.469 --> 26:39.014
Are you saying
she joined our team on purpose

26:39.097 --> 26:42.225
to get information
and take the Captain out?

26:43.518 --> 26:45.228
Hey, Gunpyeong. Get her…

26:47.105 --> 26:48.064
No.

26:48.648 --> 26:50.317
Take her things and run her prints.

26:50.400 --> 26:51.234
What?

26:51.318 --> 26:54.070
[Daesoo] Oh Hyejin
isn't actually Oh Hyejin!

26:54.154 --> 26:55.280
[Daesoo pants]

26:55.363 --> 26:57.240
That can't be her real name, right?

26:58.533 --> 27:00.994
- Shit.
- [clattering]

27:01.870 --> 27:04.122
Hey, Pildo! Snap out of it!

27:04.205 --> 27:05.790
We have to catch her, asshole!

27:05.874 --> 27:07.083
[Gunpeyong] Stop it. That's enough.

27:07.167 --> 27:09.294
- Calm down.
- [Daesoo] We have to catch her and ask

27:09.377 --> 27:11.338
why she stabbed the Captain!

27:12.339 --> 27:13.256
Damn it!

27:13.340 --> 27:14.924
- [door lock beeps]
- [door closes]

27:25.101 --> 27:26.728
Because dangerous assholes have a new drug

27:26.811 --> 27:28.146
and no one is investigating.

27:28.730 --> 27:29.856
Is that all?

27:29.939 --> 27:31.358
Four people died…

27:33.693 --> 27:36.029
if the two gangs collide, more will die.

27:37.072 --> 27:38.531
Do they kill Choi Mujin?

27:41.451 --> 27:42.702
[Pildo] Was it all…

27:44.412 --> 27:45.997
Was all that a lie?

27:46.081 --> 27:47.624
[inhales sharply]

27:50.710 --> 27:52.545
CHOI MUJIN

27:52.629 --> 27:53.922
[breathes heavily]

27:56.341 --> 27:57.801
Because you're one of them?

28:00.845 --> 28:02.847
[engine revving]

28:08.812 --> 28:11.272
Was Detective Oh your friend's daughter?

28:12.357 --> 28:15.402
The one you requested the passport for.

28:16.945 --> 28:17.946
[Mujin] Mm-hm.

28:19.406 --> 28:21.449
Did you turn yourself in then

28:22.117 --> 28:23.493
to give her a test?

28:25.662 --> 28:27.122
I had to be certain.

28:30.667 --> 28:32.627
It would be a waste to kill her.

28:33.461 --> 28:34.462
[sighs]

28:35.588 --> 28:36.840
I'm surprised.

28:37.924 --> 28:40.468
She'll be a fugitive
now that she's exposed,

28:40.552 --> 28:42.303
but she's willing to go this far.

28:43.638 --> 28:45.849
How did you convince her
to do this for you?

28:48.685 --> 28:49.686
[sighs]

28:57.235 --> 28:58.528
I tricked her.

29:00.363 --> 29:02.991
[somber music]

29:05.785 --> 29:09.205
[cell phone vibrating]

29:33.897 --> 29:35.398
[engine starts]

29:37.567 --> 29:39.736
[engine revving]

29:42.697 --> 29:44.908
[machine beeping]

29:58.171 --> 29:59.923
[Pildo] I choose to trust Detective Oh.

30:00.006 --> 30:01.466
[Cha Giho] Pildo!

30:03.760 --> 30:06.763
[Cha Giho breathing heavily]

30:08.598 --> 30:09.682
[door closes]

30:15.438 --> 30:17.857
[somber music]

30:47.512 --> 30:49.597
She got me out to kill me.

30:53.643 --> 30:55.144
[Mujin] I'm giving you my dagger.

30:59.190 --> 31:01.109
You kill him as soon as you can.

31:14.455 --> 31:15.915
[ring clinks]

31:22.046 --> 31:23.423
[Mujin] Taeju, come here.

31:23.506 --> 31:25.383
- [Donghoon] Come here.
- [Mujin] Take one with us.

31:25.466 --> 31:27.635
[both breathing heavily]

31:33.641 --> 31:35.685
[all chuckling]

31:38.104 --> 31:40.273
We'll go and get rid
of that bitch for you, sir.

31:44.652 --> 31:45.945
Where is she gone?

31:49.782 --> 31:50.825
We'll wait.

31:53.077 --> 31:54.537
She'll come on her own.

32:04.714 --> 32:06.424
Her only life goal…

32:08.593 --> 32:09.761
is me.

32:13.556 --> 32:16.225
[Jiwoo] My dad and I used to talk about
building a beach house

32:16.309 --> 32:17.602
and live in there.

32:19.145 --> 32:21.856
And I always wonder
if he were still alive now…

32:25.693 --> 32:27.528
would we be able to live like that?

32:32.033 --> 32:33.117
[sighs]

32:39.916 --> 32:41.167
[drawer scrapes]

33:02.563 --> 33:04.565
[foreboding music]

33:42.520 --> 33:48.276
PUREUNSOL MEMORIAL PARK

33:50.695 --> 33:53.364
PUREUNSOL MEMORIAL PARK
MAINTENANCE RECEIPT

33:53.448 --> 33:55.450
NEXT OF KIN: SONG JOONSU

33:56.034 --> 33:57.952
RECIPIENT: CHA GIHO

33:58.995 --> 34:00.997
[cell phone vibrates]

34:04.959 --> 34:05.793
Hey.

34:05.877 --> 34:08.129
Pildo. I just heard back.

34:09.338 --> 34:12.175
Her prints… they aren't in the system.

34:12.258 --> 34:13.718
That fucking bitch.

34:14.552 --> 34:17.221
She didn't even register her fingerprints.

34:18.431 --> 34:21.225
That means Dongcheon
bred her meticulously.

34:21.934 --> 34:23.269
It's a mess in here.

34:23.770 --> 34:25.563
Pildo. Get over here.

34:25.646 --> 34:28.649
DO NOT ENTER
UNDER INVESTIGATION

34:34.864 --> 34:36.866
[engine revving]

34:39.911 --> 34:42.121
[birds chirping]

34:51.672 --> 34:54.967
[chirping continues]

35:03.184 --> 35:06.687
DECEASED, KIM JEONGA

35:17.031 --> 35:18.533
[Jiwoo] I'm sorry, Papa.

35:20.743 --> 35:23.246
I didn't know how you had been living.

35:27.750 --> 35:29.961
If I had I wouldn't have resented you.

35:32.088 --> 35:33.840
I would've hugged you instead.

35:36.717 --> 35:39.512
It must have been so lonely
and exhausting.

35:41.889 --> 35:44.058
I think I can understand you now.

35:47.687 --> 35:48.896
I miss you,

35:49.814 --> 35:50.898
Papa.

35:57.405 --> 35:58.406
[door closes]

36:05.204 --> 36:06.455
[Daesoo] Oh, hey.

36:07.456 --> 36:09.125
What is all this, huh?

36:09.208 --> 36:10.960
What happened in this place?

36:11.043 --> 36:12.336
Damn.

36:12.420 --> 36:13.379
Everything's gone.

36:13.462 --> 36:14.547
[clatters]

36:14.630 --> 36:15.882
No one's here.

36:16.674 --> 36:20.219
Maybe Choi Mujin got rid of her
and already cleared the place out.

36:21.053 --> 36:22.054
Oh, shit.

36:22.138 --> 36:23.890
[objects clanking]

36:27.894 --> 36:29.770
Tonight's not good…

36:34.192 --> 36:36.194
DECEASED, KIM JEONGA

36:37.236 --> 36:38.821
[Jiwoo] I'll be back for you.

36:41.073 --> 36:42.158
Watch me.

36:44.076 --> 36:45.786
And see what happens.

36:55.338 --> 36:57.506
[engine revving]

37:00.301 --> 37:02.303
[revving continues]

37:06.933 --> 37:09.518
[tires screeching]

37:13.773 --> 37:16.442
- [tires screech]
- [engine revving]

37:18.152 --> 37:20.404
[tense music]

37:32.208 --> 37:33.376
[horn honks]

37:33.876 --> 37:35.044
[engine revs]

37:36.295 --> 37:37.380
[tires screech]

37:42.301 --> 37:44.178
[engine rumbling]

37:46.681 --> 37:47.765
[groans]

37:50.935 --> 37:52.103
[gunshot]

37:52.186 --> 37:53.479
[Pildo] Hey, stop!

37:53.562 --> 37:54.522
[gunshot]

37:56.440 --> 37:57.358
Turn around.

37:58.025 --> 38:00.319
[panting]

38:01.654 --> 38:03.072
Don't test me anymore.

38:05.408 --> 38:07.159
You've toyed with me enough.

38:07.952 --> 38:08.995
[pants]

38:18.337 --> 38:19.463
Hands up.

38:19.547 --> 38:21.007
[breathes heavily]

38:33.227 --> 38:37.148
You're under arrest for obstruction
of justice and attempted murder.

38:40.109 --> 38:42.820
- [groans]
- You have the right to an attorney.

38:42.903 --> 38:45.031
You may testify on your own behalf.

38:45.781 --> 38:48.826
You may challenge
the properness of arrest.

38:51.662 --> 38:56.292
A SAFE AND CLEAN CITY FULL OF HOPE

39:09.472 --> 39:10.473
[seat belt clicks]

39:23.694 --> 39:25.529
- [Daesoo] Damn it.
- [Gunpyeong] No, sir.

39:25.613 --> 39:27.531
Let go. Shit.

39:27.615 --> 39:28.866
I considered her a colleague.

39:28.949 --> 39:30.409
Hey. Look up.

39:30.493 --> 39:31.827
Hey, you…
[Daesoo sighs]

39:31.911 --> 39:33.913
Your life is over, asshole.

39:33.996 --> 39:35.706
You traitor bitch.

39:35.790 --> 39:36.832
Shit.

39:38.376 --> 39:40.378
Let go! Let go of me!

39:51.514 --> 39:53.182
Can we get her out?

39:53.265 --> 39:56.936
She stole evidence from the police agency
and was caught on camera.

39:57.520 --> 39:58.729
There's no way.

39:58.813 --> 39:59.814
Get her out.

40:00.481 --> 40:02.149
[Ms. Kang] In case she confesses?

40:03.025 --> 40:04.235
She won't do that.

40:05.611 --> 40:07.655
She's probably waiting for me now.

40:08.406 --> 40:11.617
You said she killed Mr. Jung
and will come to kill you too.

40:12.785 --> 40:15.287
Are you saying you'll make her come?

40:32.221 --> 40:33.514
[Pildo] Give us some privacy.

40:33.597 --> 40:34.723
Yes, sir.

40:39.228 --> 40:40.438
[door closes]

40:46.861 --> 40:48.863
The Captain was suspicious of you.

40:50.322 --> 40:51.699
So you stabbed him?

40:52.783 --> 40:54.743
So he wouldn't expose your identity?

41:00.040 --> 41:01.542
Why did you thank me?

41:04.086 --> 41:05.671
For being fooled by you?

41:07.715 --> 41:08.757
Tell me.

41:10.551 --> 41:13.095
Make an excuse. Lie. Say something!

41:19.810 --> 41:21.145
I trusted you.

41:25.191 --> 41:27.026
I didn't stab the Captain.

41:36.243 --> 41:37.661
If I'm honest,

41:41.081 --> 41:42.458
would you believe me?

41:57.056 --> 41:58.140
No, I can't.

41:58.933 --> 41:59.892
Forget it.

42:00.434 --> 42:04.522
♪ Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah ♪

42:05.022 --> 42:07.024
[machine beeping]

42:07.775 --> 42:08.817
[Cha Giho groans]

42:09.735 --> 42:11.028
[breathing through respirator]

42:15.282 --> 42:17.409
["My Name" playing]

42:24.708 --> 42:27.127
OH HYEJIN

42:42.309 --> 42:43.269
Your name.

42:46.939 --> 42:48.107
[Pildo] What's your name?

42:56.574 --> 42:58.158
What's your actual name?

43:07.543 --> 43:11.338
["My Name" continues playing]
